{"authors": [], "discovered_at": "2026-09-10T00:58:26.996207Z", "id": "github:release:35825593:release:385331291", "kind": "release", "matched_terms": [], "metadata": {"action": "released", "draft": false, "forks": 986, "prerelease": true, "stars": 4115, "stars_delta": 2, "tag_name": "roma2-model"}, "organization": "cdcseacave", "priority": {"source": 0.5}, "published_at": "2026-09-09T08:12:40Z", "related_items": [], "scores": {}, "source": "github", "source_id": "35825593:release:385331291", "summary": "The RoMa v2 graphs CreateStructure's --roma2 option runs in-process through ONNX Runtime: a DINOv3 descriptor graph with on-device retrieval pooling and a bidirectional coarse-match graph, preset base (640 px), fp32. scripts/fetch_roma2_model.py downloads and verifies these files against models/roma2/checksums.txt; this release is its mirror of the Hugging Face repository cDcSeacave/openmvs-roma2-onnx. The descriptor graph contains DINOv3 weights: downloading and using these files means accepting the DINOv3 License (LICENSE-DINOv3.md, attached). RoMa v2 itself is MIT (LICENSE-RoMaV2-MIT.txt).", "title": "cdcseacave/openMVS RoMa v2 ONNX model (base, fp32)", "topics": ["multi_view_stereo", "point_cloud_reconstruction", "stereo_depth"], "updated_at": "2026-09-09T08:12:40Z", "url": "https://github.com/cdcseacave/openMVS/releases/tag/roma2-model", "venue": null}
